  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/11/IMG_2605.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Esta pasada noche se ha iniciado un nuevo ciclo de Cine y cena, dentro de los jueves cuturales del Ateneo de Onda, con la proyecci&oacute;n de la comedia Vivir para gozar (1938) con Cary Grant y Katherine Hepbrun.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparicineateneu211113/img_2602.jpg\" alt=\"img_2602\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparicineateneu211113/img_2603.jpg\" alt=\"img_2603\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparicineateneu211113/img_2604.jpg\" alt=\"img_2604\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparicineateneu211113/img_2605.jpg\" alt=\"img_2605\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparicineateneu211113/img_2606.jpg\" alt=\"img_2606\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparicineateneu211113/img_2607.jpg\" alt=\"img_2607\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
